  eventId: City Cooling Day
  displayName: City Cooling Day Starts
  description: In the cyber city, people no longer feel the seasons. But machines
    still do. Temperature shifts remain a silent threat to circuitry. Machines run
    at full capacity all year long, and today, they still keep running as usual.
    To honor their endurance, city cooling says are full of imagined cooling and
    empathy to the machines!
